        "created_at": "2017-11-10T23:00:50.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>That's an unexpected surprise. :)</p><p>Usually I prefer digital versions of media because I live in a small apartment where physical things often have to be tucked in out of the way places, but I thought the starter kit would be print-only so I jumped for it anyway.</p>",
