      {
        "id": 208275,
        "name": "Chaosmancer",
        "username": "Chaosmancer",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/chaosmancer/{size}/1977_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-11-11T17:27:23.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"much0gust0\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n much0gust0:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<blockquote>\nA cool Sentinel Comics related thing for 2018\n</blockquote>\nCool, you say? Absolute Zero dating sim confirmed.\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>You know, this was obviously said in jest, but it got me thinking again about AZ's life before being part of the team. And now, all these years later, he's still kind of the loner of the team. I both want him to find someone to share his life with again, but also, we know he's going to live for a long long long time, so even if he does find someone the odds are they will die of old age and he will have to carry on.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I wonder if AZ and Haka ever had time to talk about that, or if AZ even realizes he is functionally ageless…</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 28,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:38:08.835Z",
